<title>USA: TeleSpectrum Q3 pro forma shr rises.</title>
<headline>TeleSpectrum Q3 pro forma shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pro Forma Results in 000's of dollars</p>
<p>				  3 mos ended 9/30   9 mos ended 9/30</p>
<p>					   1996    1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Revenues			   $35,750 $23,138 $98,657 $71,730</p>
<p>Operating Expenses:</p>
<p>  Cost of Services		 23,239  15,814  64,860  45,689</p>
<p>Selling, General and</p>
<p>   Administration		   6,930   4,196  19,197  14,437</p>
<p>  Goodwill Amortization	   1,750   1,750   5,251   5,251</p>
<p>   Total Operating Expenses    31,919  21,760  89,308  65,377</p>
<p> Operating Income		   3,831   1,378   9,349   6,353</p>
<p> Interest Income (Exp.), Net	294	19     283    (12)</p>
<p> Income Before Taxes		4,125   1,397   9,632   6,341</p>
<p> Income Taxes			 1,686     625   4,158   2,944</p>
<p> Net Income			   2,439     772   5,474   3,397</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share		 .10     .03     .24     .15</p>
<p> Shares Used in Computing	23,972  23,716  23,140  23,054</p>
<p>NOTES: Pro forma results include pro forma results of acquisitions completed on October 28 along with acquisitions completed with the initial public offering in August, 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is TeleSpectrum Worldwide Inc.</p>
</text>
